  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Adds llms.txt and llms-full.txt for every package, a root index, and context7.json\n- Corrects the package READMEs against the verified behavior\n- Scopes the Commands and Specifications recursion guards to the call flow and fixes the async xor composite\n- Generates T4 output per target framework, packs the llms files, and binds dependency ranges to the referenced version\n- Adds PublicApiAnalyzers with shipped API baseline\n- Fixes all diagnostics from the new analyzers\n- Regenerates lock files for new analyzer packages\n- Adds analyzers, .editorconfig, and banned API enforcement",
